529	     * Counts how many existing owners already carry the given adjusted business-day {@code registrationDate}. Invoked
530	     * before the new owner is saved, so the count reflects only owners that predate this create. Shared by
531	     * {@link #requireDailyLimitNotReached} (the hard per-day cap) and {@link #computeBulkSignupWarning} (the soft
532	     * warning threshold) so both express the same per-day count in one place.
533	     *
534	     * @param registrationDate the adjusted business-day registration date to count owners for
535	     * @return the number of existing owners registered on that day
536	     */
537	    private long countOwnersRegisteredOn(LocalDate registrationDate) {
538	        return this.clinicService.findAllOwners().stream()
539	            .filter(existing -> registrationDate.equals(existing.getRegistrationDate()))
540	            .count();
541	    }
