544	     * Determines whether creating an owner for the given adjusted business-day registration date should carry a bulk
545	     * signup warning. The warning is raised once more than 80 owners already carry that {@code registrationDate},
546	     * i.e. this create is at least the 82nd for the day. Evaluated before the new owner is saved, so the count
547	     * reflects only owners that predate it.
