744	     * Assigns the shared {@code householdId} for a newly mapped owner. The identifier is derived deterministically from
745	     * the owner's last name and postcode (see {@link HouseholdResolver#deriveHouseholdId}), so every owner sharing
746	     * those two fields resolves to the same stable value automatically, regardless of creation order and without any
747	     * explicit linking. An owner created without a postcode has no household and keeps a {@code null} identifier, so
748	     * such owners never match one another as a household.
749	     *
750	     * @param owner the newly mapped owner about to be saved
751	     */
752	    private void assignHouseholdId(Owner owner) {
753	        String postcode = owner.getPostcode();
754	        if (postcode == null || postcode.isBlank()) {
