828	    /**
829	     * Populates the owner's transient {@code householdMemberCount} with the number of owners that belong to its
830	     * household (see {@link #householdMembers}), i.e. those sharing the same non-null {@code householdId} (including the
831	     * owner itself). An owner with no household is counted as a household of one.
832	     *
833	     * @param owner the owner whose household size should be resolved
834	     */
835	    private void populateHouseholdMemberCount(Owner owner) {
836	        owner.setHouseholdMemberCount(householdMembers(owner).size());
